{"3934080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dig For Riches", "steam_appid": 3934080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⛏ Dig, Carry, Trade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go underground, the more opportunities you discover.<br><strong>Dig For Riches</strong> is a comprehensive mining simulation focused on digging, transporting, trading, and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, collect, carry, sell — invest wisely, go deeper, and grow your profits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧺 Wheelbarrow &amp; Transportation System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the items you find while digging into your <strong>wheelbarrow</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your wheelbarrow to <strong>increase capacity</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry more items and sell more in a single run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more valuable the items become</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934080/extras/b8c5bf1c10710c70b296ac0d258b506e.poster.avif?t=1773267717\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934080/extras/b8c5bf1c10710c70b296ac0d258b506e.webm?t=1773267717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934080/extras/b8c5bf1c10710c70b296ac0d258b506e.mp4?t=1773267717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💎 Resources &amp; Crystals</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breakable crystals</strong> can be found inside the mine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking crystals gives you <strong>instant money</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeper layers contain rarer and more valuable items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934080/extras/215a8a76b84eaa07b806dff1f3dfbca4.poster.avif?t=1773267717\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934080/extras/215a8a76b84eaa07b806dff1f3dfbca4.webm?t=1773267717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934080/extras/215a8a76b84eaa07b806dff1f3dfbca4.mp4?t=1773267717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚒ Pickaxe &amp; Shovel Upgrades</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pickaxe upgrades</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stronger digging power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More profit from crystals</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shovel upgrades</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Larger digging area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster and more efficient excavation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934080/extras/8a2f67e6658c276451516fe7e1251688.poster.avif?t=1773267717\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934080/extras/8a2f67e6658c276451516fe7e1251688.webm?t=1773267717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934080/extras/8a2f67e6658c276451516fe7e1251688.mp4?t=1773267717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ Energy System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digging consumes energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When energy runs out, digging stops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy drink system</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be purchased permanently with Gems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be bought instantly with Coins when needed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934080/extras/785ef2db72f59cebd28f3dd78b3f3821.poster.avif?t=1773267717\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934080/extras/785ef2db72f59cebd28f3dd78b3f3821.webm?t=1773267717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934080/extras/785ef2db72f59cebd28f3dd78b3f3821.mp4?t=1773267717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >☢ Radiation Zones</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some mining areas are radioactive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staying too long will drain your health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing the right path and leaving in time is important</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934080/extras/f03b7d26054553b20fbf855e3ba8c8b7.poster.avif?t=1773267717\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934080/extras/f03b7d26054553b20fbf855e3ba8c8b7.webm?t=1773267717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934080/extras/f03b7d26054553b20fbf855e3ba8c8b7.mp4?t=1773267717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\